body:
Hi, the `configure` widget does not apply search parameters to the UI. If you want to have a refined UI, you need to additionally set [`initialUiState`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/js/#widget-param-initialuistate) in `instantsearch()`, like this:

```js
const search = instantsearch({
  // ...
  initialUiState: {
    instant_search: {
      menu: {
        brand: 'Apple'
      }
    }
  }
});
```
